00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:01.740
And people figured out that if
you're trying to allocate power

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:05.030
to a bunch of wireless systems,
then a lot of these problems,

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:06.790
they're just convex.

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:08.407
And so those are--
and those methods

00:06:08.407 --> 00:06:09.490
are actually kind of used.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:10.480
OK.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:16.780
And like I said, a lot of
stuff was done in maybe,

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:19.330
let's see, maybe the heyday
was about 10 years ago

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:23.170
when people were looking
at models and statistics

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.710
and machine learning that
involved convex optimization

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:26.210
problems.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.418
We'll look at a lot of those.

00:06:27.418 --> 00:06:30.070
These would be things like
logistic regression, support

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:33.070
