00:24:13.370 --> 00:24:15.350
Why don't the thetas
need to sum to 1

00:24:15.350 --> 00:24:17.240
for the context [INAUDIBLE]?

00:24:17.240 --> 00:24:19.010
Why don't they need to sum to 1?

00:24:19.010 --> 00:24:20.820
Well, this is just a definition.

00:24:20.820 --> 00:24:24.590
So it is simply by fiat
and, by definition,

00:24:24.590 --> 00:24:29.210
that iconic combination-- they
don't have to add up to 1.

00:24:29.210 --> 00:24:32.810
So that's the origin
of where that--

00:24:32.810 --> 00:24:35.570
so in a convex
combination, it is simply

00:24:35.570 --> 00:24:37.530
part of the definition
that they add up to 1.

00:24:37.530 --> 00:24:40.950
So it's literally by definition
or by fiat or whatever.

00:24:40.950 --> 00:24:44.520
Yeah, OK.

