00:28:20.310 --> 00:28:21.830
So this is what a ball is.

00:28:21.830 --> 00:28:24.050
A ball is the set
of points where

00:28:24.050 --> 00:28:28.070
the norm of x minus a given
vector called xc, the center,

00:28:28.070 --> 00:28:29.750
is less than or
equal to r, where

00:28:29.750 --> 00:28:33.170
r is a positive number
called the radius.

00:28:33.170 --> 00:28:40.130
OK, so that's what an Euclidean
ball with center xc and radius

00:28:40.130 --> 00:28:41.330
r is.

00:28:41.330 --> 00:28:44.980
So that's what that is.

00:28:44.980 --> 00:28:48.420
And these are our convex.

