00:33:35.540 --> 00:33:37.730
So a norm is just a function.

00:33:37.730 --> 00:33:42.060
It's written by convention
with this weird infix form.

00:33:42.060 --> 00:33:44.210
In other words, you put
the argument in the middle,

00:33:44.210 --> 00:33:45.460
and you put these double bars.

00:33:45.460 --> 00:33:48.650
And the double bars are
