00:33:56.210 --> 00:33:59.570
So but a norm is any
function that is nonnegative.

00:33:59.570 --> 00:34:00.590
This is called definite.

00:34:00.590 --> 00:34:05.720
It says that it is 0
only if the norm is 0.

00:34:05.720 --> 00:34:08.900
And it's homogeneous
of degree 1.

00:34:08.900 --> 00:34:09.889
That's what this says.

00:34:09.889 --> 00:34:12.320
And it satisfies the
triangle inequality.

00:34:12.320 --> 00:34:14.070
And there's a bunch of norm.

